<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">FedDifRC: Unlocking the Potential of Text-to-Image Diffusion Models in Heterogeneous Federated Learning</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
