</div></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A3.F7.10" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 7</span>: </span><span id="A3.F7.11" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Analysis of <span id="A3.F7.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">FedDifRC</span> with time-steps <math id="A3.F7.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math> in Eq. <span id="A3.F7.11.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#367DBD;">9</span> (<span id="A3.F7.11.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">left</span>) and temperature <math id="A3.F7.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math> in Eq. <span id="A3.F7.11.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#367DBD;">11</span> (<span id="A3.F7.11.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">right</span>) on CIFAR10 with <math id="A3.F7.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathtt{NID1}_{0.2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝙽𝙸𝙳𝟷</mi><mn>0.2</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathtt{NID1}_{0.2}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A3.T13" class="ltx_table">
<div id="A3.T13.3" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:496.9pt;height:88.2pt;vertical-align:-40.5pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(75.0pt,-13.3pt) scale(1.43254782169784,1.43254782169784) ;">
